acceptance_criteria: "Windows recovery-text tests derive their expectations from the dialect renderer instead of a POSIX literal; The rendered-command safety test passes under bash 3.2 with history expansion, including non-ASCII arguments; A dispatched Nightly Validation run is green on every leg"
